# OPTIONAL. Public origin used for canonical URLs, Open Graph metadata,
# sitemap.xml and robots.txt.
#
# Leave unset to use the production domain, https://afrinexsolutions.co.ke.
# Set it only to build for a different origin, such as a staging server.
#
# The value is inlined at build time and every route is prerendered, so it
# must be set BEFORE the production build runs.
#
# Must be an absolute https:// origin with no trailing path or slash.
# A production build fails if an override is not https or is a localhost origin.
#
# `npm run dev` falls back to http://localhost:3000 when this is unset.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://staging.example.com
